{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And the yod of ערירי</b> is like the yod of אכזרי, and it departs from the word \"ערירים יהיו\" (Leviticus 20:21), and the meaning is as the translator [Onkelos] said:" "<b>משק ביתי,</b> on the pattern of מכס, and it is of the doubled-root [verbs], derived from \"שוקק בו\" (Isaiah 33:4), like the meaning of דֶבֶק with a segol: a son who draws himself and another with him. And so it is: ובן משק ביתי, he is בן דמשק אליעזר:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {0 "Resolved המתרגם as Onkelos, the standard Aramaic translator Ibn Ezra cites."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:39.848362697Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}